'''Simon Judeau''', otherwise known as '''the Professor''', was the cruel and devious founder of [[the Organization]] and one of the most powerful [[Seekers]] to walk the earth. The Professor was motivated by the desire to heal himself of a [[Curse of the Legendary Titans|curse]] in conjunction to his past with [[Metz]], [[Dante Vale]], and father of [[Lok Lambert]], the famous and legendary [[Seeker]], [[Eathon Lambert]]. The Professor's signature Titan was [[Araknos]], the [[Legendary Titan]] of the Mind.
